{
  "uid": "surgeguard-latency",
  "title": "SurgeGuard \u00b7 Latency & 5xx",
  "description": "Latency percentile curves, error rates, and HTTP response status codes.",
  "tags": [
    "surgeguard",
    "observability"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Latency & 5xx \u2014 origin response times, error rates, and status codes\n\n| [Edge & Traffic](/grafana/d/surgeguard-backends?{__url_time_range}) | [Queue & Tokens](/grafana/d/surgeguard-queue?{__url_time_range}) | [Infrastructure](/grafana/d/surgeguard-resources?{__url_time_range}) | [Latency & 5xx](/grafana/d/surgeguard-latency?{__url_time_range}) | [Reliability & Chaos](/grafana/d/surgeguard-failure?{__url_time_range}) | [Overview](/grafana/d/surgeguard-overview?{__url_time_range}) |",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p50 latency",
      "description": "Median origin response time.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(demo_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$rate_interval])))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "No traffic",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#10b981",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#f59e0b",
                "value": 0.3
              },
              {
                "color": "#ef4444",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
